   <conbody><ul>
            <li>
               <p>This section describes the information and specifications related to vibration sensors on the SMS.</p>
               <p>Vibrations monitoring and analysis are at the core of most condition-based monitoring systems as vibrations and harmonic signatures are often the first indication of an impending motor failure.</p>
               <p>ADI OtoSense™ SMS is equipped with a Vibration X-axis (tangential vibration) sensor and a Vibration Z-axis (axial vibration) sensor. For specifications, see Table 3.</p>
            </li>
         </ul>
