<p>Since each motor has a unique vibrational profile, the ADI OtoSense™ SMS first determines a motor’s baseline operating condition during the Learning Mode.</p>
<p>The REST API fetch the time and frequency domain data to display it on the web and mobile application. Signal processing allows for the quick identification of key signal characteristics which form the basis of the analysis.</p></conbody>
